<view class="topic">
  Advice
</view>
<view class="help">
  <view>
    1. Add magnesium-rich foods (spinach, nuts, beans) to daily meals; take light salt and diluted electrolyte drinks only for workouts over 1 hour, stick to whole carbs and drink enough plain water daily.
  </view>
  <view>
    2. Keep single training under 60 minutes, avoid exercising in extreme heat; eat magnesium supplements within 30 mins post-workout and add 2–3 weekly strength sessions to reduce mineral loss.
  </view>
  <view>
    3. Sleep 7–9 hours daily, limit heavy caffeine; shower right after sweating to soothe acidic sweat irritation, and retest sweat indicators every 1–2 weeks to adjust your routine.
  </view>
</view>
